=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ GREP @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt GNU grep @VERSION@ for OpenVMS
1 'NOTICE
=prompt GNU grep is free software under the GNU GPL, version 3 or later.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [GREP.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for GNU grep
    At system startup: to define GREP$ROOT at every boot, add this line to
    SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:GREP$STARTUP.COM
    For each user: to define grep, egrep and fgrep, add this line to LOGIN.COM:
    $ @GREP$ROOT:[000000]GREP$SETUP.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE GREP removes the product and deassigns GREP$ROOT.
